    description: Some("Guide Cookie Monster along cookie-strewn maze paths to the cookie jar — a pre-reading exercise in tracing and directional arrows dressed up as a Sesame Street outing, with ten game levels spanning solo, cooperative and competitive play for ages three to seven. It plays on the Kid\'s Controller keypad with its snap-in cardboard overlay, sold separately from the cart."),
